um }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand ${m}_{ij}$ and ${M}_{ij}$ are the minimum and maximum values of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nNow, since ${m}_{ij}={M}_{ij}=-1,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)=U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(-1)\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & =-1({\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i})({\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}) \\\\  & =-1(2-(-2))(10-8) \\\\  & =-1\\cdot 4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\nL(f,P)=-8\\le {∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A\\le -8=U(f,P)\n$$\n\nwhich implies that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=-8.\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364915 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364916 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364917 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364918 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364919 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364915 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364914 1080 #uuid "9c303871-2c67-599d-b4b9-385476d8014c" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364915 1081 "-8" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364915 1084 #uuid "6e859b87-d2ed-5097-829c-da7b2c3a61a7" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364916 1081 "8" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364916 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364916 1084 #uuid "228d4188-00cc-54b2-a34d-a83c20d9f4b6" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364917 1081 "-4" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186364917 1083 #edb/ref 1759218604