R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, setting ${x}_{2}=1,$ we get the eigenvector \n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere $‖v‖=\\sqrt{2}.$ Dividing $v$ by its norm, we obtain the normalized eigenvector: \n\n$$\nu=\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFinally, the required orthogonal projection matrix is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot {u}^{T} & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365067 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365068 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365069 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365070 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365071 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365067 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365066 1080 #uuid "1feaaa2b-9f91-5604-bad3-f9a41903fec2" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365067 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365067 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365067 1084 #uuid "259bc7f0-def1-5dbe-84fa-df884b75de5b" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365068 1081 "\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365068 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 1