and $\\text{Im}(T)={[x,y,z]^{T}\\,:\\,x-y+2z=0}.$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365093 1072 #uuid "d46dc660-c500-5191-bb8e-c57af2a79535" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365093 1074 "Solving $x-y+2z=0$ for $y,$ we get $y=x+2z.$ Therefore, any vector from $\\text{Im}(T)$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ x+2z \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=x{{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{v}_{1}}+z{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{v}_{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis means that $\\text{Im}(T)=\\text{Span}{{v}_{1},{v}_{2}}.$ Therefore, $\\text{rank}(T)=2.$ \n\nFinally, according the rank-nullity theorem, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{nullity}(T) & =3-\\text{rank}(T) \\\\  & =3-2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365095 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365096 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365097 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365098 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365099 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365097 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365094 1080 #uuid "21b56c28-66a7-5c9c-958b-62a19e62e9a3" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365095 1081 "3" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365095 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365095 1084 #uuid "26a0bbbf-f8e6-5ff8-a774-523eba137101" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365096 1081 "2" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365096 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365096 1084 #uuid "5b688