$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}2{a}_{i}({b}_{j}-4) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}2{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({b}_{j}-4).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}2{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({b}_{j}-4) & =(2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j}-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}4) \\\\  & =(2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j}-4{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}1) \\\\  & =(2\\cdot 24)\\cdot (95-4\\cdot 20) \\\\  & =(48)\\cdot (95-80) \\\\  & =(48)\\cdot (15) \\\\  & =720\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365151 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365152 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365153 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365154 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365155 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365154 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365150 1080 #uuid "c9243378-63d5-5d9e-b148-966c205a0aa5" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365151 1081 "788" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365151 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365151 1084 #uuid "70f5f51f-ac08-5d7c-81b3-1189a267d827" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365152 1081 "780" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365152 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365152 1084 #uuid "2a046fbc-a0bb-5953-a968-e083c9210bba" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365153 1081 "710" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365153 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 1