 above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-9{x}^{2}+12y-18x & =9 \\\\ {y}^{2}+12y-9{x}^{2}-18x & =9 \\\\ [{y}^{2}+12y]-9[{x}^{2}+2x] & =9 \\\\ [(y+6)^{2}-36]-9[(x+1)^{2}-1] & =9 \\\\ (y+6)^{2}-36-9(x+1)^{2}+9 & =9 \\\\ (y+6)^{2}-9(x+1)^{2} & =9+36-9 \\\\ (y+6)^{2}-9(x+1)^{2} & =36 \\\\ \\frac{(y+6)^{2}}{{6}^{2}}-\\frac{(x+1)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-(-6))^{2}}{{6}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-(-1))^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center is $(\\,-1,-6\\,).$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365596 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365597 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365596 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365596 1077 "field-1" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365596 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365597 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365596 1080 #uuid "a96b2b09-be74-5fe8-86c9-27bbf1c96415" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365597 1081 "-1" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365597 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365597 1084 #uuid "05369156-ec02-5d2b-99a3-eda850011d0f" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365598 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365599 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365598 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365598 1077 "field-2" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365598 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365599 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365598 1080 #uuid "46f42e42-5b67-5f00-bfa9-25b0c054bba6" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365599 1081 "-6" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365599 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365599 1084 #uuid "cb8e8d45-5ac9-54d1-aafb-76a8785c852c" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365600 1068 #edb/ref 17592186365601 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365600 106