gravity is $a=-g.$ Substituting into our previous equation, we can solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n-g=-\\frac{k}{{R}^{2}}\\,\\,\\,⟹\\,k=g{R}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting back into the equation, we get\n\n$$\na=-\\frac{g{R}^{2}}{{r}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nNow, since acceleration $a$ is the derivative of velocity $v,$ which is the derivative of distance $r,$ we can express acceleration as follows using the chain rule, treating $v$ as a function of $r$ along the trajectory:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{dv}{dt} \\\\  & =\\frac{dr}{dt}\\cdot \\frac{dv}{dr} \\\\  & =v\\frac{dv}{dr}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this result into our equation, we obtain a separable differential equation for the velocity:\n\n$$\nv\\frac{dv}{dr}=-\\frac{g{R}^{2}}{{r}^{2}}\n$$\n\nSolving using separation of variables, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int v\\frac{dv}{dr}\\,dr & =\\int (-\\frac{g{R}^{2}}{{r}^{2}})\\,dr \\\\ \\int v\\,dv & =-g{R}^{2}\\int \\frac{1}{{r}^{2}}\\,dr \\\\ \\frac{{v}^{2}}{2} & =-g{R}^{2}(-\\frac{1}{r})+{C}_{1} \\\\ {v}^{2} & =\\frac{2g{R}^{2}}{r}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $C=2{C}_{1}$ is a constant of integration.\n\nLet ${v}_{0}$ be the initial velocity of the object. Applying the initial condition $v(R)={v}_{0},$ we can solve for $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(R)^{2} & =\\frac{2g{R}^{2}}{R}+C \\\\ {v}_{0}^{2} & =2gR+C \\\\ C & ={v}_{0}^{2}-2gR\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation for the velocity of the object is\n\n$$\n{v}^{2}=\\frac{2g{R}^{2}}{r}+{v}_{0}^{2}-2gR.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting in the values\n$R=(5\\times {10}^{8}),$\n$g=9,$ and\n${v}_{0}=(1.2\\times {10}^{5}),$\nwe conclude that the equation for the velocity is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}^{2} & =\\frac{2\\cdot 9\\cdot (5\\times {10}^{8})^{2}}{r}+(1.2\\times {10}^{5})^{2}-2\\cdot 9\\cdot (5\\times {10}^{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{450\\times {10}^{16}}{r}+(1.44\\times {10}^{10})-(9\\times {10}^{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4.5\\times {10}^{18}}{r}+(14.4\\times {10}^{9})-(9\\times {10}^{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4.5\\times {10}^{18}}{r}+((14.4-9)\\times {10}^{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4.5\\times {10}^{18}}{r}+(5.4\\times {10}^{9}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365755 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365756 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365757 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365758 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186365759 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1079 #edb/ref 17592186365757 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365754 1080 #uuid "54ddeb15-24ce-5063-8338-21a9e8f7ab82" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365755 1081 "{v}^{2}=\\frac{2.25\\times {10}^{18}}{r}-(1.44\\times {10}^{10})" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365755 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365755 1084 #uuid "6d72036d-f499-5da5-84bb-887df07e964a" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365756 1081 "{v}^{2}=\\frac{2.25\\times {10}^{18}}{r}+(5.4\\times {10}^{9})" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365756 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365756 1084 #uuid "4dee8621-fb18-5939-921f-54b29640ca54" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365757 1081 "{v}^{2}=\\frac{4.5\\times {10}^{18}}{r}+(5.4\\times {10}^{9})" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365757 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365757 1084 #uuid "b02f327e-80bb-5bab-8017-7218b4e3cdd9" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365758 1081 "{v}^{2}=\\frac{4.5\\times {10}^{18}}{{r}^{2}}+(5.4\\times {10}^{9})" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186365758 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 1