 & | & |\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we reduce the left-hand side to reduced row echelon form using Gaussian elimination. Then, on the right-hand side, we will obtain the $B$-matrix for $T:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -1 & -2\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -7 & -18\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:=(-1){R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 7 & 18\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-3{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -18 & -46 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 7 & 18\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n[\\,T\\,]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}-18 & -46 \\\\ 7 & 18\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366034 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366035 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366036 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366037 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366038 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366034 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366033 1080 #uuid "70a7b172-559d-5091-a001-52505496df62" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366034 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-18 & -46 \\\\ 7 & 18\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366034 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366034 1084 #uuid "d3410129-052f-5e7b-a3e7-b02753ed2115" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366035 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -6 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [