nd ${x}_{i}=a+iΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=4.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{3}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{n}=\\frac{b-4}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=7.\n$$\n\nConsequently, ${x}_{i}=4+\\frac{3i}{n}$ and $f({x}_{i})={x}_{i}^{3}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{4}^{7}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{(4+\\frac{3i}{n})}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $f(x)={x}^{3}$ and $b=7.$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366166 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366167 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366168 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366169 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366170 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366167 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366165 1080 #uuid "24cfe0c6-efb9-5afc-b56a-61a0caf09182" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366166 1081 "$f(x)=(x+2)^{3}$ and $b=7$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366166 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366166 1084 #uuid "e8cd826f-58a3-53f3-aa32-8e8009f34e9a" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366167 1081 "$f(x)={x}^{3}$ and $b=7$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366167 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366167 1084 #uuid "26c00d20-c2c8-5017-8c58-bc84d579333c" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366168 1081 "$f(x)=(x+2)^{3}$ and $b=5$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366168 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [175