186045585 true] [17592186366204 1074 "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 2 & -1 \\\\ x & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ x & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 \\\\ x & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(-2+2)i-(-4+x)j+(8-2x)k \\\\  & =⟨0,4-x,8-2x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(4-x)^{2}+(8-2x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16-8x+{x}^{2}+64-32x+4{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5{x}^{2}-40x+80}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{20} \\\\ \\sqrt{5{x}^{2}-40x+80} & =\\sqrt{20} \\\\ 5{x}^{2}-40x+80 & =20 \\\\ 5{x}^{2}-40x+60 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-8x+12 & =0 \\\\ (x-2)(x-6) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=2,\\,6.$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366206 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366207 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366208 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366209 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366210 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366210 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366205 1080 #uuid "b200d0bf-bed1-5cf6-8f1e-f47e978d20c7" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366206 1081 "x=-3,\\,2" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366206 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366206 1084 #uuid "9c6f3048-c777-5c58-90fe-219a1e995028" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366207 