$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366357 1072 #uuid "92e09859-2a3a-5255-8ffb-72547639c5f4" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366357 1074 "First, we need to find a point on the plane. If $r=⟨x,y,z⟩,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,4,1⟩ & =3 \\\\ -2x+4y+z & =3 \\\\ z & =3+2x-4y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $x=1$ and $y=1,$ we get \n\n$$\nz=3+2(1)-4(1)=1.\n$$\n\nSo, the point $Q(1,1,1)$ lies on the plane. \n\nNow, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨1,1,1⟩-⟨-3,-4,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,5,9⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨-2,4,1⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|4\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 4+9\\cdot 1|}{\\sqrt{(-2)^{2}+{4}^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-8+20+9|}{\\sqrt{4+16+1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|21|}{\\sqrt{21}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{21}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366359 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366360 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366361 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366362 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366363 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366359 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366358 1080 #uuid "030f319e-0c23-5f25-ab63-9b411cec6724" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366359 1081 "\\sqrt{21}" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [1759218