{1},{v}_{2}}={[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ \\frac{9}{2} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}]}$ is an orthogonal basis for $\\text{Col}(A).$\n\nFinally, $a=6,$ $b=\\frac{9}{2},$ and  \n\n$$\n\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{(6)}{(\\frac{9}{2})}=\\frac{4}{3}.\n$$" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366387 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366388 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366389 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366390 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366391 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366387 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366386 1080 #uuid "a1b294cd-0690-5b2a-8b79-bfdfd5228580" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366387 1081 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366387 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366387 1084 #uuid "3a1f7f88-f4d6-55ab-96bb-e95b8529508e" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366388 1081 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366388 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366388 1084 #uuid "761d56bb-9090-5642-9a0c-e14547f22359" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366389 1081 "27" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366389 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366389 1084 #uuid "8c80468f-7fc8-5012-914f-f4ac6b573a98" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366390 1081 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366390 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366390 1084 #uuid "