 true] [17592186366657 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366658 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366659 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366660 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366661 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366662 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366660 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366657 1080 #uuid "569a193f-62cf-5f57-802a-680eb03d7d8a" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366658 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366658 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366658 1084 #uuid "a450aee2-99f2-5fef-b32b-444d27b258df" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366659 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366659 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366659 1084 #uuid "f5af8bc3-a290-52c4-b954-67f30cf5f4e7" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366660 1081 "I only" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366660 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366660 1084 #uuid "85118970-19fe-55d8-b044-f7efb2a142df" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366661 1081 "III only" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366661 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366661 1084 #uuid "0ea7484e-2d96-5c67-bd88-e9df44a88f7a" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366662 1081 "II only" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366662 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366662 1084 #uuid "b3f7ec47-4e38-5f0c-8421-bf17435d6a72" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1068 #edb/ref 17592186366664 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1069 "q-95702" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1071 "Given that $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ real symmetric matrix whose roots of the characteristic polynomial have multiplicity equal to $1,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\n- If $u$ and $v$ are two eigenvectors that correspond to the same eigenvalue, then $u$ is parallel to $v$\n- $A$ must have $7$ real and distinct eigenvalues\n- $A$ is orthogonal" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1072 #uuid "531e02eb-ae49-5805-b616-b28b7ddc3a97" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366663 1074 "Given that $A$ is an $n\\times n$ symmetric matrix over $R$, the spectral theorem states the following:\n\n- The eigenvalues of $A$ are all real.\n\n- Eigenvectors corresponding to different eigenvalues are orthogonal.\n\n- The dimension of the eigenspace for each eigenvalue equals the multiplicity of that eigenvalue as a root of the characteristic polynomial.\n\n- $A$ is orthogonally diagonalizable.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. According to the theorem, eigenvectors corresponding to different eigenvalues must be orthogonal. But two eigenvectors that correspond to the same eigenvalue will always be parallel if the geometric multiplicity of the eigenvalue is $1.$\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, the eigenvalues of a symmetric matrix are real. Also, since the roots of the characteristic polynomial have (algebraic) multiplicity all equal to $1,$ the eigenvalues are all distinct.\n\n- Statement III is false. According to the theorem, any symmetric matrix with real entries is orthogonally diagonalizable, but not necessarily orthogonal.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366664 1075 #e