^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{x}_{2}^{2}}{9}=0.\n$$\n\nThis equation defines the single point $(0,0)$ in the ${x}_{1}{x}_{2}$-plane. \n\nNotice that the other equations do not define a single point: \n\n- ${C}_{2}\\,:\\,{x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2}=0$ defines a pair of intersecting lines in the ${x}_{1}{x}_{2}$-plane.\n\n- ${C}_{3}\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}_{1}^{2}}{9}-\\frac{{x}_{2}^{2}}{4}=1$ is the equation of a hyperbola with semiaxes $3$ and $2.$\n\n- ${C}_{4}\\,:\\,{x}_{2}=2{x}_{1}^{2}$ is the equation of a parabola that opens in the direction of the positive ${x}_{2}$-axis.\n\n- ${C}_{5}\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}_{1}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{x}_{2}^{2}}{9}=-1$ has no points in the ${x}_{1}{x}_{2}$-plane that satisfy the equation (imaginary ellipse)." 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366712 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366713 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366714 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366715 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366716 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1077 "selection" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1079 #edb/ref 17592186366714 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366711 1080 #uuid "192d289b-e276-5fff-a77a-a52732a5826a" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366712 1081 "{C}_{2}\\,:\\,{x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2}=0" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366712 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366712 1084 #uuid "c0babb91-b22c-51a9-9062-778233361d5c" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366713 1081 "{C}_{4}\\,:\\,{x}_{2}=2{x}_{1}^{2}" 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366713 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533447 17592186045585 true] [17592186366713 1084 #uuid "335c97c5-ed5c-5fe4